{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/pulls/80","id":4536255099,"node_id":"PR_kwDOT2gtDc8AAAABDmHCew","html_url":"https://github.com/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/pull/80","diff_url":"https://github.com/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/pull/80.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/pull/80.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/issues/80","number":80,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat(M14-005): verify protected develop source CI provenance","user":{"login":"Chengyue-Lu","id":140945476,"node_id":"U_kgDOCGaoRA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/140945476?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu","html_url":"https://github.com/Chengyue-Lu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Chengyue-Lu/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 治理元数据\n\n- **PR 类型**: feature\n- **任务 ID**: M14-005\n- **风险等级**: R2\n- **责任人**: @Chengyue-Lu\n- **工作流目录**: docs/workstreams/chengyue-lu/M14-CURATED-RELEASE\n\n## 范围与非目标\n\n闭合 source-CI producer/consumer 的实现缺口：develop push 在 CI 内重验实际 squash delta 的治理；在线 observer 核验仓库、workflow、run、attempt、job、check App 的身份和成功状态。同步 PR #78/#79 已接受状态与后续真实 push 验收路径。\n\n## 契约与权威影响\n\n- **共享契约**: yes\n- **权威、权限或数据边界**: yes\n\n新增 source governance 只在 develop push 上名为 governance；其他事件使用独立 inactive 名称，保留现有 PR-only governance 门禁。生产端读取唯一 exact merged PR 的当前 metadata，重验 parent→source 与 reviewed/integrated tree 一致；消费端不接受 PR/dispatch rehearsal 或旧 attempt，逐项绑定 GitHub Actions app 15368 和 run check suite，分页不全、重复/缺失/失败/skipped job、rerun 竞态均 fail closed。\n\n## TASKS 状态变更\n\nnone。M14-005 保持 BLOCKED；canonical Task identity、状态、依赖、验收不变。Runtime、Schema、Registry、Skill admission、release policy 和 dormant topology 不变。\n\n## 验证证据\n\nM14-005 implementation slice: 65978304329be2ac58326181f864e642b94df9c0。\n15 个 source-CI fixture / identity matrix / CLI / workflow checks PASS；新增 critical observer line 100% / branch 100%，95/90 与独立正反证据映射已纳入 coverage policy。\n在线负例：旧的绿色 develop@0bebafd CI 34939526577 因缺少 governance 被明确拒绝。该 run 不能冒充已完成 source attestation。\n联合 focused 247 PASS；repository 186/0/0；最终文档 10 PASS；governance 与 final CI plan PASS。Trace 无 BLOCK，保留 capture-gap warning。最终 head f662c3796ed81cff7a956bf0d284381d62a9937b 的[托管 CI 34961312410](https://github.com/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/actions/runs/34961312410) 已全部通过，下载的 plan / test / coverage 回执已逐项核对绑定与摘要：\n\n- Python 3.11.16 与 3.13.15 full 各 1246/1246 PASS，无失败或 skip；coverage execution 1246 PASS，coverage-quality 测量子集 1220 PASS。\n- 全局行覆盖率 94.64%；governance checker 行 98.21% / 分支 97.95%；新增 source-CI observer 行 150/150、分支 18/18，均为 100%。\n- documentation、repository smoke、两版本 compatibility / package smoke / required test 均 PASS；独立 [PR governance 34961312359](https://github.com/Chengyue-Lu/research-agent-workbench/actions/runs/34961312359) PASS。develop push 专用 source job 在 PR 事件按设计跳过，其名称与 required governance 分离。\n- Base: 0bebafd81f0116a8269c63ac97378038a1eb2a5d；head: f662c3796ed81cff7a956bf0d284381d62a9937b；实际测试的 PR merge target: d43b821f5674325e52e85aaf4cc26abc0e508c03。\n- Hosted plan ID: 9c4417aee583ea6ed640212280b2547a1018bfc3fefd188f7245a0a7309c9696；full behavioral + impact/repository coverage + package；plan digest 与每份测试回执的 target/plan 绑定均一致。\n\n以上为本 PR 的验证证据；真实 protected develop push 的 producer receipt 与在线 attestation 仍须在合入后验收。冻结 Attempt 记录实现提交，最终 head 的托管回执在本 PR 保留，既有档案保持冻结。\n\n## 剩余风险与后续\n\n首个真实 source_governance job 只有在本 PR 被 R2 接受并合入 develop 后才会运行；当前 PR CI 不能替代那条 protected push 证据。合入后在该 source checkout 调用 observer 并核对 producer receipt，再接 release-only workflow/checks、policy include 与 atomic cutover。具名首发版本/范围决定、fresh ruleset readback、freeze/source-parent、projection/prospective-tree equality、R2 release PR 和 tag/artifact closure 仍需独立闭合。\n\nObserver 每次在线读取 GitHub，输出 JSON 只作证据；最终受保护 release caller 须自己调用在线 observer。仅靠保存的 JSON、PR body、candidate manifest 不授予信任。历史 PR metadata 若被后续改为不兼容内容，producer 重跑可能 fail closed；记录明确它读取的是当前 merged PR body。\n\n## 权威依据\n\nIssue #57、ADR-0021、已接受 PR #78 readiness preparation，以及维护者本轮指令“继续推进M14-005”。本 PR 为 develop-side preparation，不代作 Human first-release decision，不创建发布分支、tag 或真实发布，不改变远端权限。\n\n## 对抗性证据\n\n真实 Git fixture 重验 squash parent、reviewed tree 与实际治理器，拒绝无关联/多关联/未合并/跨仓 PR、错误 parent/tree 和非法治理元数据。API matrix 拒绝跨仓/错 workflow/错 SHA、PR/dispatch run、旧 attempt、非 Actions App、同名伪 check、分页缺口及观察期间 rerun。测试验证 inactive source job 不与 PR governance 共名。\n\n实施细节与合入后步骤：docs/workstreams/chengyue-lu/M14-CURATED-RELEASE/SOURCE_CI.md。Refs #57。\n\n\nAttempt: work/M14-005/A-20260915-003/INDEX.yaml。两个未发布的留痕预检失败分别因工具名声明和 native CRLF 属性产生；其原字节与失败回执保留，最终档案校验通过。Native CRLF receipts 通过限定到该档案 tool-events 的 cr-at-eol 属性保留，既有冻结档案未改写。\n","created_at":"2026-09-15T11:04:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T13:23:08Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"let778750-cpu","id":240712654,"node_id":"U_kgDODlj7zg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/240712654?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/let778750-cpu","html_url":"https://github.com/let778750-cpu","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/let778750-cpu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/let778750-cpu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/let778750-cpu/